F]primary_workspace_ownership.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/primary_workspace_ownership.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-mq[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-mq/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Workspace ownership and mutation contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ownership-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ownership-contract: codify writable operational contexts and make [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonical primary-project access read-only by default.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Durable operational workspace leases[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]operation-leases[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ownership-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]operation-leases: add reusable claimed-workspace lifecycle support for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]synchronous jobs, monitors, and detached procs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reset-and-replay conflict recovery[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]disposable-retry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after operation-leases[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]disposable-retry: recover conflicts by resetting only leased [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]machine-owned checkouts and replaying bounded idempotent operations.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Approval and task launches off the primary checkout[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]approval-launches[dim] · [dim][/dim]after disposable-retry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]approval-launches: move approval-time plan archiving plus epic and task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]launch orchestration into durable operational workspace leases.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Background bead mutations off canonical primary clones[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]background-mutators[dim] · [dim][/dim]after disposable-retry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]background-mutators: route runner and scheduled bead writers through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writable workspace-local stores while retaining canonical stores for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reads.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Generic primary-sidecar auto-sync[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sidecar-autosync[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ownership-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar-autosync: add opt-in clean fast-forward synchronization for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plans, beads, research, and arbitrary configured sidecars.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end ownership audit and regression gates[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]invariant-audit[dim] · [dim][/dim]after approval-launches, background-mutators, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]sidecar-autosync[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]invariant-audit: prove primary-checkout immutability, disposable retry [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]safety, and sidecar convergence across automated workflows.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-mq","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-mq.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-61fc0dfe0e32f7603d081d18d98ce418","started_at":"2026-08-16T03:44:01.403046+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_